      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Precipitation strengthening will improve the mechanical performance of MnNiSi-based magnetic-refrigeration materials.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The precipitation-strengthening treatment will largely retain the intrinsic large magnetocaloric effect.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial MnNiSi-based alloy exhibits a pronounced magnetocaloric effect.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial MnNiSi-based alloy has modest mechanical strength.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ti is an example of a dopant capable of promoting stable precipitates.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Performing the heat treatment below the magnetic transition temperature will avoid disturbing the magnetostructural transition.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An inert heat-treatment atmosphere will prevent oxidation.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A precisely controlled cooling rate will optimize precipitate size and distribution.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will form finely dispersed coherent nanoprecipitates within the MnNiSi matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanoprecipitates will impede dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Impeded dislocation motion will increase yield strength.",
      "field": "mechanism; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Precipitation strengthening will increase tensile strength.",
      "field": "mechanism; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will improve fracture toughness relative to the untreated alloy.",
